 r←GetReleaseList_ row;id;date;version
⍝ Returns one release of the list of releases on a package page; see `GetReleaseList`.
⍝ It links to the release's configuration and, when it has any, to its dependencies.
 (id date)←row
 version←id↓⍨2⊃⍸'-'=id                              ⍝ All after the name, the hyphen of a beta included
 r←'<li><span><span class="release-version">',(EscapeSpecialChars version),'</span>'
 r,←'<span class="release-date">',((≢'YYYY-MM-DD')↑date),'</span></span>'
 r,←'<span class="release-links"><a href="',Reg.VersionOf_REST,'/packages/details/',id,'">config</a>'
 :If PackageHasDependencies id
     r,←'<a href="',Reg.VersionOf_REST,'/packages/dependencies/',id,'">dependencies</a>'
 :EndIf
 r,←'</span></li>'
⍝Done
